# sadic: exact kernels for S-adic directive shifts (docs/sadic-kernel-g2-slice.md).
#   directive  sofic directive shifts, the BST19 Arnoux-Rauzy and Brun families
#   cocycle    checked incidence cocycle, positive blocks, Hilbert cross-ratio bound
#   balance    balance of finite words; exact lower bounds on S-adic balance
#   spectrum   characteristic polynomial, unit-disc count, Pisot and irreducibility verdicts
#   periodic   periodic points: Brun family, admissibility, Lyndon words, verdict pipeline
# Nothing here asserts a limit, a spectrum, or a theorem about an infinite
# directive sequence; every result is a statement about the finite data given.
